@startuml
title 脆家 -> 安置：開啟安置個案（FHIR 設計草稿）
hide footbox
actor "脆家社工" as Worker
participant "脆家平台" as VFS
participant "脆家 FHIR Server" as VFSServer
participant "安置系統" as Placement

Worker -> VFS: 點選「開啟安置個案」
VFS -> VFSServer: 建立／取得 Patient、RelatedPerson、Practitioner
VFS -> VFSServer: 建立 ServiceRequest\n（安置個案開啟請求）
note right of VFSServer
ServiceRequest.subject -> Patient
ServiceRequest.requester -> Practitioner
RelatedPerson.relationship 表達父、母或其他關係
end note
VFSServer -> Placement: Bundle / FHIR API\nPatient + RelatedPerson* + Practitioner + ServiceRequest
Placement -> Placement: 驗證請求者身分與授權
Placement -> Placement: 建立 Task\n（受理安置請求）
alt 受理
  Placement --> VFSServer: Task.businessStatus = 已受理\nTask.output = 安置端案件編號
else 退回／不受理
  Placement --> VFSServer: Task.businessStatus = 退回／不受理\nTask.output = 原因
end
@enduml
